# Grounded for Life: "This spell costs {3} less to cast if it targets a tapped creature. Destroy target creature." The total
# cost is determined once the target is announced (CR 601.2c, 601.2f). Bot2's first Ornithopter attacked on turn 4 and is
# still tapped on Bot1's turn 5; the second is untapped. With only {W}{W} in Bot1's pool, the cast at the untapped
# Ornithopter ({4}{W}) is not offered; the cast at the tapped one costs {1}{W}, empties the pool and destroys it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Grounded for Life
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter#1 > Bot1)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{W}
! Bot1.Hand.Grounded for Life.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Grounded for Life.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Grounded for Life
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
